Copyright (c) 2026 Tiberiu Balasea

In the public context, because a call relayed in by the proxy is not one
FreeSWITCH has authenticated and vanilla puts those here. 9000 answers and
plays the built-in stream, so the lab needs no sound files of its own; hold and
resume need nothing at all, since mod_sofia handles the re-INVITE itself.
-->
<include>
  <extension name="sipral_lab">
    <condition field="destination_number" expression="^9000$">
      <action application="answer"/>
      <action application="playback" data="local_stream://moh"/>
    </condition>
  </extension>
</include>
